{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組一般選舉，投票於傍晚6時結束。 <br/>\n<br/>\n截至傍晚6時，臨時累積投票率98.79%，5640名選民投票。<br/>\n<br/>\n有合資格的選民形容，選舉氣氛熱鬧，又說選委會角色重要，要考慮國家和香港發展，會視乎候選人政綱和理念作出投票決定。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T11:03:44.651117+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T10:36:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T11:37:26.535011+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:57:25.191442+00:00","content_hash":"e6bdd752285209f6ea49eff146b6bf885c35b886b085a55cb565f7dba56ca63f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}